# MRO PROCUREMENT SOLUTION ERP
## MASTER PROMPT — AUTOMATED VENDOR INTELLIGENCE + CATALOGUE + WEBSITE ANALYSIS

I have an existing **MRO PROCUREMENT SOLUTION ERP**.

DO NOT rebuild the ERP from scratch.

First inspect the existing application, database, backend/API, Vendor Master, Brand Master, Category Master, Product Master, Catalogue/Import modules, Requirement Management, RFQ Management, Vendor Product Mapping and all related services.

Preserve all existing ERP functionality and data.

The objective of this enhancement is to make **Vendor Master intelligent**.

When I add a new vendor, the ERP should automatically analyse the vendor's catalogue, PDF, Excel, images, website and other supplied information and identify:

- What products the vendor deals in
- Which brands the vendor deals in
- Which material categories they supply
- Product families
- Product types
- Part numbers / model numbers
- Manufacturer codes
- Technical specifications
- UOM where identifiable
- Available catalogue rates/MRP where available
- Product/application information
- Website product information
- Contact/company information where available
- Confidence level of each identification
- Source of each identified data

The system must NEVER blindly guess or create incorrect master data.

